<title>GERMANY: Fresenius buys German consulting group.</title>
<headline>Fresenius buys German consulting group.</headline>
<dateline>BAD HOMBURG, Germany 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German dialysis group Fresenius Medical Care said on Monday that it has taken over the Heidelberg-based PIC Pharmaceutical Industry Consulting GmbH.</p>
<p>Fresenius said PIC, which is a consulting and engineering group, had 1995 sales of about 800,000 marks and 16 employees.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
